The term "brother-in-law" is in the definition. It is not just a bad
keyword.

Unfortunately, like so many words, the only existing definition of the word
is in English.

Obviously a Lojban definition would not have any such problems.

to pu benji ti fo lo mi me la.android. samcku toi

mu'o mi'e.aionys.
